PROVINCES

  O superfluous one, I have kept well a list of all provinces which have had
the wisdom to submit to thy yoke.  Here, then, are the lands of thy Empire:

                                                    Recruiting Types:
Province            Tax    Race   Terrain  Expl%    Type 1     Type 2
the Dolphin Sea      10     Elf   Forest   100%     Bowmen    Hvy Cav

  The province of the Dolphin Sea owes allegiance to your Majesty.  Turning 
to the northeast, one can see a rich Forest area, which is known as the 
Jellyfish Sea (#1105).  It is populated by Dwarves and Tao-Li rules there.  
Their Dwarven warriors fight as Axemen and Fleet.  To the east lies a Forest 
area called Falkenheim (#1106), populated by Eagles.  It is ruled by no one. 
If need be, they can muster an army of Eagles to defend their province.  
Southeast of here lies the poor province of Mare Tarkium (#1107), ruled by 
no one.  It is known to be a Forest province inhabited by Dragons.  They can 
call on an army of Dragons to defend their province.  Viewing the southwest
ern horizon, a man can see a Forest province called the Icaria Sea (#1007).  
It is said that Amalric reigns there.  It is known to be occupied by Humans. 
Their Human warriors prefer to fight as Legion and Heavy Cavalry.  To the 
west there is a Forest province known as the Mermaid Sea (#906), a land of 
Elves where Lallipugh reigns.  Their Elven warriors traditionally fight in 
the style of Bowmen and Heavy Cavalry.  Northwest of here is the Virgo Sea 
(#1005), a Forest area owned by Melantheus, where Elves dwell.  Their Elven 
warriors fight as Axemen and Heavy Cavalry.

